Study on construction technology of
overlapping tunnel shield construction under railway business line
Zhu Xingxing1 2
1. Baohe District Housing and Urban-Rural Development Bureau of Hefei City Hefei Anhui 230601 China
2. Hefei Baohe District Municipal Engineering Management Office Hefei Anhui 230601 China
Abstract The article takes Hefei Metro Line 8 Yaoyuan Road Station-Lingbi Road Station interval tunnel up and down overlap
ping through the railroad track group project as an example according to the engineering geology conditions and construction
difficulties it analyzes risks existing in construction process. and studies the control measures digging parameters and monito
ring control in the process of shield construction so as to ensure the operation safety of the track group and the quality of con
struction.
Key words shield overlap boring parameters tunnel
